  "conclusion": "No substantial resident regression observed: worst mean loss 1.08 percent versus main and 0.18 percent versus original; all async mean comparisons positive. Two main confidence intervals extend below minus3percent, so this is not proof of a universal three-percent bound. Hardware counters confirm sync minus 1 and async minus 10 retired instructions versus original.",
